Request the renewal of one or more domain names.

USAGE:
  scw domain order renew [arg=value ...]

ARGS:
  domains.{index}        List of domains to renew.
  [duration-in-years]    Duration in years for the domain renewal. Subject to TLD-specific minimum and maximum constraints.
  [force-late-renewal]   Confirm the late renewal (incurs extra fees).

FLAGS:
  -h, --help                help for renew
      --list-sub-commands   List all subcommands

GLOBAL FLAGS:
  -B, --beta             Enable beta mode
  -c, --config string    The path to the config file
  -D, --debug            Enable debug mode
  -H, --no-headers       Skip headers in human output
  -o, --output string    Output format: json or human, see 'scw help output' for more info (default "human")
  -p, --profile string   The config profile to use
